file construction/ITINERARY.md the fold recorded and the byte tension surfaced as Keaton's choice
recommend check-in (checkpoint) the session-logs pin is 5,421 over its bound with three honest answers and no measurement to choose between them -- shorter rows, an intra-day fold, or a bound wrong for this room
